  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda Multi-Donor Civil Society Support Programme (2015-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened civil society engagement on critical social cohesion, reconciliation and governance issues in Rwanda.  DFID will provide funding and technical support to Rwandan civil society organisations to support the design and implementation of governance and reconciliation focused initiatives, and to support more effective engagement (influencing) with government on these issues.</narrative>
  </description>
